WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Now I've blocked a disaster for you

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,320
Just want you to apologize

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:05,900
You don't want this matter to fall apart in one fell swoop.

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,960
Then you have to pay it back just now

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,740
As for the fight between you two?

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,300
I can send you out of the club politely.

7
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,100
Let you fight outside

8
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:21,530
It has nothing to do with us, fine. I apologize.

9
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:24,870
Please apologize in front of all of us. I'm sorry.

10
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:27,170
It was true that I drank too much and was talking nonsense just now.

11
00:00:27,690 --> 00:00:32,100
I'm really sorry to apologize to you and your girlfriend here.

12
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:33,940
For the sake of this big brother

13
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:38,580
I won’t argue with you this time. Yes, Mr. Lu.

14
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,380
This guy is really a talent.

15
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:41,900
Handle things without rushing or reporting them

16
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:44,220
And there are degrees of advancement and retreat. Where did you find it?

17
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:46,520
And he's not timid at all

18
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:49,080
No where to find it

19
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:51,900
I just happened to see what he was doing outside.

20
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:53,680
With the intention of helping him

21
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:55,480
I didn’t expect that he is really a talent.

22
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:58,300
Then just take care of him
